
<!doctype html><html lang="de"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>VHS English – Holiday & Vacation</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f5f8f7;color:#202725;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.6}main{max-width:1000px;margin:auto;padding:28px 20px 55px}.hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#123f3a,#187568);border-radius:20px;padding:44px;margin-bottom:42px;color:#fff}.eyebrow{margin:0 0 10px;color:#d8eeea;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}.hero h1{margin:0 0 14px;color:#fff;font:700 46px/1.1 Georgia,serif}.hero p{max-width:700px;margin:0;color:#f4f9f8;font-size:17px}.section{margin-bottom:48px}.heading{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:8px}.heading svg{width:30px;height:30px;color:#d8794c}h2{margin:0;color:#123f3a;font:700 28px/1.25 Georgia,serif}.subtitle{margin:0 0 22px;color:#596561;font-size:15px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}.card,.task{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9e5e2;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(18,63,58,.06)}.card{padding:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.en{margin-bottom:7px;color:#123f3a;font-size:17px;font-weight:700}.tag{display:inline-block;padding:4px 10px;background:#e8f4f2;color:#176f63;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;align-self:flex-start}.example{margin:12px 0 0;color:#4e5956;font-size:14px;font-style:italic;flex-grow:1}.action-area{margin-top:15px;padding-top:15px;border-top:1px dashed #d9e5e2}.btn-translate{background:#fff;color:#176f63;border:1px solid #176f63;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer;width:100%}.translation{display:none;margin-top:10px;color:#d8794c;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;text-align:center}.tip{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:24px;padding:18px 20px;background:#fff9f5;border:1px solid #edd8cb;border-left:5px solid #d8794c;border-radius:12px}.tip svg{width:27px;height:27px;color:#d8794c;flex:none}.tip strong{display:block;color:#123f3a}.tip p{margin:3px 0 0;color:#4e5956;font-size:14px}.tasks{display:grid;gap:18px}.task{display:flex;gap:18px;padding:22px}.icon{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:#e8f4f2;color:#176f63;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none;font-size:24px}.label{display:block;margin-bottom:3px;color:#d8794c;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}h3{margin:0 0 8px;color:#123f3a;font-size:19px}.task p,.task li{color:#202725;font-size:15px}.task p{margin:0 0 10px}.task ul{margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:22px}.task li{margin-bottom:7px;font-size:14.5px}.task em{color:#176f63}.source{margin:40px 0 0;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid #d9e5e2;color:#747f7b;font-size:12px;font-style:italic}@media(max-width:800px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:560px){main{padding:12px 10px 40px}.hero{padding:30px 24px}.hero h1{font-size:34px}.hero p{font-size:15px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}h2{font-size:23px}.task{flex-direction:column;padding:20px}}</style></head><body><main><section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">VHS Englischkurs · Vocabulary & Speaking Activities</p><h1>Holiday & Vacation</h1><p>English for planning, describing and talking about holidays, trips and experiences abroad</p></section><section class="section"><div class="heading"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 19.5V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14M6 20h13M8 8h7M8 12h7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><h2>Vocabulary</h2></div><p class="subtitle">Important words and expressions for this topic.</p><div class="grid"><div class="card"><div class="en">go on holiday</div><span class="tag">holiday</span><p class="example">We usually go on holiday in July.</p><div class="action-area"><button class="btn-translate" onclick="toggleTranslation(this)">Übersetzung zeigen</button><div class="translation">in den Urlaub fahren</div></div></div><div class="card"><div class="en">book a hotel</div><span class="tag">accommodation</span><p class="example">I’d like to book a hotel for five nights.</p><div class="action-area"><button class="btn-translate" onclick="toggleTranslation(this)">Übersetzung zeigen</button><div class="translation">ein Hotel buchen</div></div></div><div class="card"><div class="en">flight</div><span class="tag">travel</span><p class="example">Our flight leaves at six in the morning.</p><div class="action-area"><button class="btn-translate" onclick="toggleTranslation(this)">Übersetzung zeigen</button><div class="translation">Flug</div></div></div><div class="card"><div class="en">return ticket</div><span class="tag">travel</span><p class="example">Can I have a return ticket, please?</p><div class="action-area"><button class="btn-translate" onclick="toggleTranslation(this)">Übersetzung zeigen</button><div class="translation">Hin- und Rückfahrkarte</div></div></div><div class="card"><div class="en">single room</div><span class="tag">hotel</span><p class="example">I’d like to book a single room.</p><div class="action-area"><button class="btn-translate" onclick="toggleTranslation(this)">Übersetzung zeigen</button><div class="translation">Einzelzimmer</div></div></div><div class="card"><div class="en">double room</div><span class="tag">hotel</span><p class="example">Do you have a double room with a balcony?</p><div class="action-area"><button class="btn-translate" onclick="toggleTranslation(this)">Übersetzung zeigen</button><div class="translation">Doppelzimmer</div></div></div><div class="card"><div class="en">breakfast included</div><span class="tag">hotel</span><p class="example">Is breakfast included in the price?</p><div class="action-area"><button class="btn-translate" onclick="toggleTranslation(this)">Übersetzung zeigen</button><div class="translation">Frühstück inklusive</div></div></div><div class="card"><div class="en">check in / check out</div><span class="tag">hotel</span><p class="example">We can check in after 3 p.m.</p><div class="action-area"><button class="btn-translate" onclick="toggleTranslation(this)">Übersetzung zeigen</button><div class="translation">einchecken / auschecken</div></div></div><div class="card"><div class="en">beach</div><span class="tag">places</span><p class="example">The beach is only five minutes from our hotel.</p><div class="action-area"><button class="btn-translate" onclick="toggleTranslation(this)">Übersetzung zeigen</button><div class="translation">Strand</div></div></div><div class="card"><div class="en">sightseeing</div><span class="tag">activities</span><p class="example">We spent the afternoon sightseeing.</p><div class="action-area"><button class="btn-translate" onclick="toggleTranslation(this)">Übersetzung zeigen</button><div class="translation">Besichtigung / Sightseeing</div></div></div><div class="card"><div class="en">souvenir</div><span class="tag">holiday</span><p class="example">I bought a small souvenir for my family.</p><div class="action-area"><button class="btn-translate" onclick="toggleTranslation(this)">Übersetzung zeigen</button><div class="translation">Souvenir / Andenken</div></div></div><div class="card"><div class="en">relax</div><span class="tag">activities</span><p class="example">I just want to relax by the pool.</p><div class="action-area"><button class="btn-translate" onclick="toggleTranslation(this)">Übersetzung zeigen</button><div class="translation">sich entspannen</div></div></div><div class="card"><div class="en">sunny / rainy</div><span class="tag">weather</span><p class="example">It was sunny in the morning but rainy later.</p><div class="action-area"><button class="btn-translate" onclick="toggleTranslation(this)">Übersetzung zeigen</button><div class="translation">sonnig / regnerisch</div></div></div><div class="card"><div class="en">abroad</div><span class="tag">travel</span><p class="example">Have you ever travelled abroad alone?</p><div class="action-area"><button class="btn-translate" onclick="toggleTranslation(this)">Übersetzung zeigen</button><div class="translation">im Ausland</div></div></div><div class="card"><div class="en">travel insurance</div><span class="tag">travel</span><p class="example">It’s a good idea to get travel insurance.</p><div class="action-area"><button class="btn-translate" onclick="toggleTranslation(this)">Übersetzung zeigen</button><div class="translation">Reiseversicherung</div></div></div></div><div class="tip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M12 8v.01M12 11v5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><div><strong>Teaching Tip</strong><p>Ask learners to make three sentences about their own holiday plans before the discussion.</p></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="heading"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 5h16v10H8l-4 4V5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><h2>Further Discussion Activities</h2></div><p class="subtitle">Follow-up practice – speaking, pair work and small-group discussion.</p><div class="tasks"><div class="task"><div class="icon">👥</div><div><span class="label">A · Partner Work</span><h3>Holiday Interview</h3><p>Interview your partner about a recent or ideal holiday.</p><ul><li>Where did you go or would you like to go?</li><li>Who would you travel with?</li><li>What would you do there?</li><li>What was the best part?</li></ul></div></div><div class="task"><div class="icon">💬</div><div><span class="label">B · Small Group (3–4)</span><h3>Plan the Perfect Holiday</h3><p>Plan a seven-day holiday together.</p><ul><li>Choose a destination and accommodation.</li><li>Decide how you will travel.</li><li>Choose three activities.</li><li>Present your plan.</li></ul></div></div><div class="task"><div class="icon">⇌</div><div><span class="label">C · Partner Work</span><h3>Compare Holidays</h3><p>Compare two types of holiday using comparative forms.</p><ul><li>Beach holiday vs. city break.</li><li>Hotel vs. apartment.</li><li>Plane vs. train.</li><li>Say which you prefer and why.</li></ul></div></div><div class="task"><div class="icon">✈️</div><div><span class="label">D · Role Play</span><h3>At the Hotel Reception</h3><p>One person is the receptionist, the other is a guest.</p><ul><li>Check in and ask about breakfast.</li><li>Ask about the area.</li><li>Report a problem with the room.</li><li>Ask about check-out.</li></ul></div></div><div class="task"><div class="icon">✎</div><div><span class="label">E · Speaking</span><h3>Holiday Story</h3><p>Tell a short story about a memorable holiday.</p><ul><li>Say where you went.</li><li>Describe one interesting experience.</li><li>Explain what you liked or disliked.</li><li>Would you go again?</li></ul></div></div></div></section><p class="source">Original supplementary material for a VHS English course. Vocabulary, examples and activities are newly written for classroom use.</p></main><script>function toggleTranslation(btn){const d=btn.nextElementSibling;if(d.style.display==='block'){d.style.display='none';btn.textContent='Übersetzung zeigen';btn.style.background='#fff';btn.style.color='#176f63'}else{d.style.display='block';btn.textContent='Übersetzung verbergen';btn.style.background='#e8f4f2';btn.style.color='#123f3a'}}</script></body></html>
